+
+# RozeLynx PAM passkeys (local platform authenticator)
+# Variables:
+#  $hostname (String): the origin (website) asking for verification.
+webauthn-rozelynx-pam-verify-prompt = Look at the camera or wait for the password prompt to continue with { $hostname }.
+webauthn-rozelynx-pam-password-prompt = Enter your account password to continue.
+# Variables:
+#  $hostname (String): the origin (website) asking to create a passkey.
+webauthn-rozelynx-pam-select-prompt = { $hostname } wants to create a passkey. Choose where to save it:
+webauthn-rozelynx-pam-select-device = This device (face recognition / password)
+webauthn-rozelynx-pam-select-usb = USB security key
